  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 503.08 Method of Delivery for Required Notifications and Updates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 503.08 Method of Delivery for Required Notifications and Updates. The owner of a PWS shall:\n\n(a) Provide the notice required by Env-Dw 503.02(d), and Env-Dw 503.03 through Env-Dw 503.07, by email or, if email is not feasible, by postal mail, messenger, hand, or other means of delivery; and\n\n(b) Follow up to confirm delivery, if the method of delivery does not automatically provide confirmation.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 503) #10465, eff 12-2-13; ss by #14006, eff 6-25-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw500.html"
